Scope and historical grants
---------------------------

The MIT license above covers the Legir-authored bindings, authoring layer and
native extensions, including Legir-authored files retaining historical
BSD-3-Clause headers. MIT is an additional license option for those files;
their previous BSD-3-Clause grant is retained below. Native file headers are
preserved to keep the pinned source and WASM provenance unchanged.

This MIT grant does not relicense PDFium, Emscripten or their bundled
third-party dependencies. Their original terms and notices remain in
wasm/licenses/ and must accompany redistribution of the compiled engine.

